  "Total 60 as published; 'Ships, Vehicles, Weapons (8)' and the other headers are section labels, not cards.",
  "Starting Interrupt as posted ('Any Methods Necessary (usual start)'; the strategy calls it 'the default start' and names other starts by matchup: Security Precautions vs Hidden Base, A Bright Center To The Universe vs Operatives, Broken Concentration vs Jedi Testing, Crush The Rebellion vs Yavin IV/Nudj). Any Methods Necessary is the Enhanced Cloud City Interrupt. 'Coruscant (s)' is posted with an '(s)' mark, kept as an ordinary location.",
  "Posted '4-LOM with Gun' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Iggy with Gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Dengar with Gun' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Mara's Saber' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Twi-lek Advisor' Twi'lek Advisor; 'Scum and Villany' Scum And Villainy; 'Tatooine Lars Moisture Farm' the Dark site.",
  "The post credits most of the deck to Nicholas \"Olas\" Burks, who posted a similar version in January (the Any Methods Necessary start was his idea)."
